#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom/scripts.inc:292
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom_Text_ContinueWithChallenge"
msgid ""
"Will you continue with\n"
"your challenge?$"
msgstr "你要继续挑战吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom/scripts.inc:296
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom_Text_SaveChallengeAndQuit"
msgid ""
"Would you like to save your challenge\n"
"and quit the game for now?$"
msgstr ""
"要记录挑战进度，\n"
"暂时结束游戏吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom/scripts.inc:300
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom_Text_RetireFromChallenge"
msgid ""
"Do you wish to retire from your\n"
"Battle Choice challenge?$"
msgstr "你要放弃对战抉择的挑战吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom/scripts.inc:304
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom_Text_AwaitingReturnSaveBeforeResume"
msgid ""
"We've been awaiting your return…\p"
"Before resuming your Battle Choice\n"
"challenge, let me save the game…$"
msgstr ""
"我们一直在等你回来……\p"
"继续对战抉择的挑战之前，\n"
"让我先记录游戏进度……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom/scripts.inc:309
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom_Text_PleaseEnjoyChallenge"
msgid ""
"Please do enjoy your Battle Choice\n"
"challenge…$"
msgstr ""
"请尽情享受\n"
"对战抉择的挑战……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom/scripts.inc:313
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom_Text_SavingYourData"
msgid ""
"I am saving your data…\n"
"A little time, please…$"
msgstr ""
"正在记录你的数据……\n"
"请稍等片刻……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom/scripts.inc:317
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePike_Text_PathBlockedNoTurningBack"
msgid ""
"The path is blocked!\n"
"And there is no turning back…$"
msgstr ""
"路被堵住了！\n"
"而且已经无法回头了……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom/scripts.inc:321
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom_Text_FindingItDifficultToChoose"
msgid ""
"I beg your pardon, but…\p"
"Are you perhaps finding it difficult\n"
"to choose your path?$"
msgstr ""
"非常抱歉……\p"
"你是不是很难\n"
"决定走哪条路呢？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom/scripts.inc:326
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom_Text_ApologizeForImpertinence"
msgid ""
"I see…\n"
"I apologize for my impertinence…$"
msgstr ""
"原来如此……\n"
"恕我冒昧了……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom/scripts.inc:330
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom_Text_SomethingAboutRightPath"
msgid ""
"Ah, let me see… There is something\n"
"about the path on the right…$"
msgstr ""
"啊，让我看看……\n"
"右边的路上好像有什么……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom/scripts.inc:334
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom_Text_SomethingAboutCenterPath"
msgid ""
"Ah, let me see… There is something\n"
"about the path in the center…$"
msgstr ""
"啊，让我看看……\n"
"中间的路上好像有什么……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom/scripts.inc:338
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom_Text_SomethingAboutLeftPath"
msgid ""
"Ah, let me see… There is something\n"
"about the path on the left…$"
msgstr ""
"啊，让我看看……\n"
"左边的路上好像有什么……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom/scripts.inc:342
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom_Text_AromaOfPokemon"
msgid ""
"It seems to have the distinct aroma\n"
"of POKéMON wafting around it…$"
msgstr ""
"那里似乎飘荡着\n"
"一股宝可梦特有的气味……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom/scripts.inc:346
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom_Text_PresenceOfPeople"
msgid ""
"Is it… A TRAINER?\n"
"I sense the presence of people…$"
msgstr ""
"是……训练家吗？\n"
"我感觉到了人的气息……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom/scripts.inc:350
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom_Text_HeardWhispering"
msgid ""
"I seem to have heard something…\n"
"It may have been whispering…$"
msgstr ""
"我好像听到了什么……\n"
"也许是窃窃私语声……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom/scripts.inc:354
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom_Text_WaveOfNostaliga"
msgid ""
"For some odd reason, I felt a wave\n"
"of nostalgia coming from it…$"
msgstr ""
"不知为什么，\n"
"我从那里感到了一阵怀念……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom/scripts.inc:358
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom_Text_TerrifyingEvent"
msgid ""
"I am sorry to say…\p"
"A terrifying event, yes, a horrible one,\n"
"is about to befall you…\p"
"I urge you to pay the utmost care\n"
"and prepare for the worst…$"
msgstr ""
"很遗憾……\p"
"可怕的事情，没错，非常可怕的事情\n"
"即将降临到你身上……\p"
"请你务必万分小心，\n"
"做好最坏的打算……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom/scripts.inc:365
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattlePikeThreePathRoom_Text_DreadfulPresence"
msgid ""
"From every path I sense a dreadful\n"
"presence…$"
msgstr ""
"我从每条路上\n"
"都感觉到了可怕的气息……$"
